t go anywhere after all. A big snowstorm has just moved in.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: But I've been scheduled to work tomorrow!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Luckily, my boss is pretty flexible. To be honest, I don't think we should be on the road under these conditions.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: As a kid, I used to love playing outside in the snow all day.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We'd better book another night here, but we ought to do it now.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Peter, you're so decisive.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I'm just being realistic.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You might want to call Marco and put off lunch tomorrow.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, that self-absorbed nincompoop isn't going to like that.", "id": 2, "time": "26000", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Last winter, we watched so many movies when Boston was snowed in. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I used to binge-watch TV shows with my brother on snow days. We would watch <span class=\"italic\">24</span> back to back.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  My old boyfriend used to be impulsive like that. We would watch all the <span class=\"italic\">Bourne</span> movies in one day.", "id": 3, "time": "44500", "image": "engenn6le10ob03re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le10ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}